                                                                    <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="649-ex-I1e">
                                                                        <rect key="frame" x="5" y="5" width="782" height="64.5"/>
                                                                        <string key="text">I certify that I have examined the joint work location and reviewed the work procedures and permits related to this Work procedures and have been briefed of all hazards and emergency response plans.  I authorize this work in accordance with the conditions and guidelines contained in the JHA and approved permits.  This and any referenced permits shall be voided if unsafe conditions arise or if any safe work procedures required on the individual permits or work plans are not met.</string>
